        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly a bush plane on the moon of a gas giant. Do deliveries, challenges and explore an open world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>simplified flight model</strong>, you can just focus on the fun parts of flying, landing and manoeuvring the aircraft. You don't need to worry about any details for handling real aircraft, like propeller reaction forces and trim tabs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are <strong>optimized for</strong> <strong>gamepad and keyboard + mouse</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HOTAS and flight joysticks are not supported.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seed is used to generate a new <strong>procedural open world</strong> for each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your <strong>difficulty</strong>. Your game can range from a calm world where you can relax in undisturbed skies to a place where you have to battle heavy rain, snow, wind, turbulence and fog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full size of the game is about <strong>150MB</strong> and it runs well on a beat up Dell Vostro 15 3000 from 2022.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original</strong> <strong>soundtrack</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I strongly dislike generative AI, so none was used for making this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bugs and Feature Requests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please use the Community Hub for reporting bugs or requesting features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly a bush plane on the moon of a gas giant. Do deliveries, challenges and explore an open world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>simplified flight model</strong>, you can just focus on the fun parts of flying, landing and manoeuvring the aircraft. You don't need to worry about any details for handling real aircraft, like propeller reaction forces and trim tabs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are <strong>optimized for</strong> <strong>gamepad and keyboard + mouse</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HOTAS and flight joysticks are not supported.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seed is used to generate a new <strong>procedural open world</strong> for each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your <strong>difficulty</strong>. Your game can range from a calm world where you can relax in undisturbed skies to a place where you have to battle heavy rain, snow, wind, turbulence and fog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full size of the game is about <strong>150MB</strong> and it runs well on a beat up Dell Vostro 15 3000 from 2022.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original</strong> <strong>soundtrack</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I strongly dislike generative AI, so none was used for making this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bugs and Feature Requests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please use the Community Hub for reporting bugs or requesting features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Fly a bush plane on the moon of a gas giant. Do deliveries, challenges and explore an open world.",
